WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.080
In the Yuan dynasty, zaju drama flourished greatly, and there were performances in the theatres every day.

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:11.462
The theatre was filled with audience members, every one watching in fascination.

00:00:11.812 --> 00:00:16.420
The great writer Guan Hanqing wrote many famous plays.

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:21.330
These stories stayed close to the common people's lives and were deeply loved by everyone.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:26.240
Wang Shifu wrote romantic, moving love stories.

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:32.278
In a garden, the young lovers met; the story was warm and touching.

00:00:32.628 --> 00:00:38.148
Ma Zhiyuan's works are full of poetry and imaginings of faraway places.

00:00:38.498 --> 00:00:43.370
The autumn mountain scenery and the singing filled people's hearts with emotion.

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:48.976
The actors sang, spoke, acted and fought on stage, and the audience watched as if spellbound.

00:00:49.326 --> 00:00:54.846
Yuan songs, like Tang poetry and Song lyrics, became a representative treasure of Chinese literature.

00:00:55.196 --> 00:00:59.588
Hundreds of years later, people still love these moving works.

